Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Kumar <kumar@nabu>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libglib2.0-0t64, libqmi-glib5, libprotobuf-c1
Description: Library for exposing Qualcomm Sensor Core sensors to Linux
